We observe the following exception while using org.apache.kafka:kafka-clients:jar:2.5.1  as part of a Spring Boot application running in a docker container on openjdk:13-jdk-alpine3.1. 

 

  	j.l.IllegalMonitorStateException: null
	at java.lang.Object.wait(Object.java)
	at o.a.k.common.utils.SystemTime.waitObject(SystemTime.java:55)
	at o.a.k.c.p.i.ProducerMetadata.awaitUpdate(ProducerMetadata.java:119)
	at o.a.k.c.producer.KafkaProducer.waitOnMetadata(KafkaProducer.java:1029)
