----
Workarounds (Until Fixed)
 # Increase retention period to reduce likelihood of epoch deletion

 # Monitor consumer lag to ensure it stays low

 # Reduce rebalance frequency (increase max.poll.interval.ms, session.timeout.ms)

 # Use cooperative rebalance strategy to minimize rebalance impact

 # Consider using auto.offset.reset=latest if reprocessing is more costly than data loss (application-dependent)

